: "005.png", "id": "1039875214854716", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393516_1039875218188049_231288402583328065_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=euN7zdg88-UQ7kNvwEfiVWc&_nc_oc=AdrRGKjdSyxsV7_AOePnlpltgF1OUATYtmBCZ3SEKtriRI4AQerPQ3qeT2IsW0-Qt4E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRBzpN5x7x-VMf6iEu-OtUKyRGj81cHUPDIg8tBxZ3qzQ&oe=6AF9DEA7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "005.png", "id": "517509354762187", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391952_517509358095520_2919512691968294005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g1baHPR-CGcQ7kNvwGfS0EW&_nc_oc=AdqTwctx1N-e8q1HH2hMrZuWPqhZnlt4OOE-2jEk7GyERuCHMNd__lI70eUmtvcYgZ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRyZlK9cKr0kD4LD3zl14mCTg0aZzufjYEszYI9jG8STw&oe=6AF9C189"}, "display_name": "Legends BMX", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Legends BMX VR** brings BMX action to Mixed Reality on Meta Quest. Overlay 3D bikeparks onto your real-world environment using passthrough and ride freely within your space.\n\n- Resize the track to fit your room.  \n- Link up insane tricks and climb the global rankings.  \n- Join weekly challenges and compete on *online leaderboards*.\n\n**Actively developed, but already solid and fun**  \nWhile we're actively improving and expanding the game, this VR version already offers a complete and stable experience. *Legends BMX* is also being developed for PC and consoles, where it's being very well received.\n\nJump into the park and help us fine-tune the final experience.  \nThanks for being part of the journey \u2014 see you in the park!\n", "short_description": "Pure flow and adrenaline \u2014 now in Mixed Reality!\nRide your BMX through dynamic parks superimposed on your real-world space. Pull off insane tricks, chase high scores, and feel the thrill of BMX in a whole new way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "develope